{"tournament": {"id": 9888667, "name": "OCC June Qualifier - Bracket A", "url": "d7m3veuv", "description": "<p><span style='margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-family: Whitney, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; color: rgb(220, 221, 222); white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgb(54, 57, 63);'>Qualifier Brackets - June 12th @ 1300 GMT (deck list deadline June 12th @ 1200 GMT)</span><span style='color: rgb(220, 221, 222); font-family: Whitney, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgb(54, 57, 63);'>\r\n             - </span><span style='margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Whitney, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(220, 221, 222); white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgb(54, 57, 63);'><em>The qualifier brackets are seeded based on the position of the player on the OC leader-board at the end of the season.\r\n\r\n</em><strong>The winner of Bracket A will qualify for position #7 seeding in the Final 8 main event.</strong><em>\r\n\r\n</em><span style=\"font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;\">Round of 8 Finals - June 19th @ 1300 GMT (deck list deadline June 16th @ 2300 GMT)</span><span style=\"font-style: normal;\">\r\n           -</span><em>The Round of 8 Finals are seeded based on OC leaderboard at the end of the season in addition to the final 2 qualified players being positioned in #7 and #8.</em><em>\r\n</em></span></p>", "tournament_type": "single elimination", "started_at": "2021-06-12T14:35:48.832+02:00", "completed_at": "2021-06-12T17:44:11.775+02:00", "require_score_agreement": false, "notify_users_when_matches_open": false, "created_at": "2021-06-04T16:26:23.667+02:00", "updated_at": "2021-06-12T17:44:11.929+02:0